{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RuJaA6dKpJ1794490909.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方打擊「白牌車」，拘捕五名本地男子及七名內地男子，並扣查12輛涉案私家車。</p><p></p><p>警員由上月27日起，通過網絡巡查、情報分析及臥底行動，打擊「白牌車」。12名被捕男子，都涉嫌非法駕駛汽車作出租或載客取酬用途，及駕駛時沒有第三者風險保險，其中七名內地男子亦涉嫌違反逗留條件。五名本地男子已獲准保釋候查，分別須於11月下旬及12月上旬向警方報到。七名內地男子已被落案起訴，正還柙候審。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:23:59.001467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:38:41.987170+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:17:20.775877+00:00","content_hash":"8b0ba4d4818fd3599e205e552f9e2bbeb163441cf20efe13d7d03c8271b5627f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:23:59.001467+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}